Modifications relative to upstream
----------------------------------

Tracked in the pi-python git history under tui/. At vendor time:

- Relocated the Cargo workspace from the grok-build repository root into
  tui/ of the pi-python monorepo.
- Added this NOTICE and .gitattributes (LF for shebangs / Rust sources)
  so Windows checkouts do not break bin/protoc.

Phase 4 fork changes (also in git history under tui/):

- Interactive spawn is `python -m pi_agent_cli` over standard ACP stdio
  (override with `PI_AGENT_COMMAND` / `PI_PYTHON`). Home is `PI_HOME` /
  `GROK_HOME` / `~/.pi-python`.
- Outbound `x.ai/*` / `_x.ai/*` extension RPCs are dropped in `acp_send`
  so they never reach the Python agent. Vendor `_meta` keys are not
  written on initialize / session create.
- Product binary is `pi` (`pi-grok-pager-bin`). PTY e2e crates
  (`ptyctl`, `ptyctl-cli`, `pi-grok-pager-pty-harness`) were removed.

